**/src/main
**/tests/test_*
!**/tests/test_*.wyn
!**/tests/test_*.js

# ---- wyncanvas ----
# Build artifact of wyncanvas/csrc/build.sh - regenerate with ./csrc/build.sh
wyncanvas/libwynimg/
wyncanvas/build/
wyncanvas/packages/
wyncanvas/wyn.lock
# Design docs and dogfooding findings live in the private internal-docs repo,
# never here: they cite absolute local paths, unshipped compiler internals, and
# forward roadmap. `specs/` matters as much as `plans/` - the wyncanvas spec was
# committed here once and had to be removed after the fact.
# Leading **/ matters: a bare `docs/superpowers/` is anchored to the repo ROOT and
# would not match `wyncanvas/docs/superpowers/`, which is where it actually was.
**/WYN_FINDINGS.md
**/docs/superpowers/
# Python bytecode from the math-lib wrapper's generated module
__pycache__/
*.pyc
